# Files the agent must never read.
# Only effective while `.kiroignore` is listed in the VS Code setting
# `kiroAgent.agentIgnoreFiles` (see .vscode/settings.json).
# Note: a file under an excluded DIRECTORY cannot be re-included, so exclude
# by pattern rather than by folder when a sibling must stay readable.

# Secrets & credentials
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials/
**/credentials

# Noise: lockfiles and installed trees
*-lock.yml
*-lock.yaml
*-lock.json
node_modules/
**/node_modules
.venv/
**/.venv
